          "prepTime": 0,
          "speakTime": 180,
          "prompt": "<h3>Part 1: Social Interaction (3 minutes)</h3>\n<p>Let's talk about <strong>friends</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Do you often meet your friends?</li>\n  <li>What do you usually do when you meet them?</li>\n  <li>In your opinion, what qualities should a good friend have?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let's talk about <strong>art</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Do you like art?</li>\n  <li>Why do you like it?</li>\n  <li>Do you think people should join painting classes? Why or why not?</li>\n</ul>",
          "solution": "<p><strong>Suggested Answer:</strong> I loved playing football and drawing when I was young. Today, I still play football sometimes. In my free time, I like reading or walking in the park. Having free time is essential for mental health.</p>"
